    "Removed ImageProcessingWrite.image_pages; extra=forbid rejects old KB configuration requests with HTTP422 REQUEST_INVALID.",
    "Upload rejects image_pages in process_overrides and as a direct multipart field (including empty value) with HTTP422 IMAGE_PAGES_UNSUPPORTED before runtime upload.",
